flowchart TD
  Enter[Open studio] --> Choose{Choose source}
  Choose --> File[Load local file]
  Choose --> Mic[Grant mic permission and record]
  Choose --> Link[Paste direct media URL]
  File --> Ready[Review source and limits]
  Mic --> Ready
  Link --> Ready
  Ready --> Configure[Engine / fallback / language / speakers]
  Configure --> Submit[Submit]
  Submit --> Outcome{Result}
  Outcome -->|Success| Review[Review and edit text]
  Outcome -->|Failure| Explain[Explain code and attempts]
  Explain --> Configure
  Review --> TXT[Copy or TXT from edited text]
  Review --> SRT[SRT from timed segments]
